# GOVERNMENT GRIEVANCE REDRESSAL PORTAL
## MySQL Database Implementation, JOIN Queries & Relational Schema Verification

- **Database:** MySQL 8.4 (or PostgreSQL 15 Compatible)
- **Report Type:** Database Practical / Project Documentation
- **Prepared for:** Academic Submission

