## 5. JOIN OPERATIONS

### 5.1 INNER JOIN
**Description:** Returns only records that have matching values in both tables based on the join predicate. Citizens who have not filed any grievances are omitted.

```sql
SELECT 
    u.name AS citizen_name,
    u.phone_number,
    g.tracking_id,
    g.subject,
    g.priority,
    g.status
FROM users u
INNER JOIN grievances g
    ON u.id = g.citizen_id;
```

#### MySQL CLI Output:
```text
