### 5.3 RIGHT JOIN
**Description:** Returns all rows from the right table (`grievances`), matched with records from the left table (`feedbacks`). Unreviewed grievances return `NULL` for rating and feedback fields.

```sql
SELECT 
    g.tracking_id,
    g.subject,
    g.status,
    f.rating,
    f.comment,
    f.is_appealed
FROM feedbacks f
RIGHT JOIN grievances g
    ON f.grievance_id = g.id;
```

